## steering order

`objective > foundation > domain > code-standard > gates and behaviour tests > implementation`

| tier | file | answers |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | `objective.md` | why, and what winning is |
| 2 | `foundation.md` | the invariants every decision obeys |
